  "limits": [
    "Real Local standalone Canvas and Agent Server 1.60.1, installed Chrome, unmodified control-openhands. All six registered themes at 1440x1000 and 390x844.",
    "Live controls: provider/connection selects, enabled and disabled primary submit, active agent-profile badge. Same computed paints, font metrics, geometry and disabled states in all 36 pairs.",
    "A real DeepSeek preset and provider connection arranged owned preconditions. Standard setup validation occurred, but no conversation or agent generation was started, no profiles were bulk-created and no external Git/Slack write was performed.",
    "The same public --oh-background and --oh-accent-foreground references are proven in actual scoped app/library CSS. Cloud/ACP, meta-profile badge and other primary button consumers, host embedding and custom host-variable overrides are source/compiler/unit coverage, not live browser claims.",
    "Original PNGs and complete native clips are unchanged. The film samples both viewports in Neutral/Paper and desktop stills of the remaining themes, with short Before/After labels and very quiet original ambience.",
    "Both owned runs were stopped and private-purged; their ten reserved ports are closed. Existing services were untouched."
